+// The scale (>= 0.2) that makes skin_window_resize's ceil(original * scale)
+// fit inside |target| without intermediate integer truncation (ModAVD#249).
+// With |dpr| > 1.0 (when -no-hidpi-scaling divides ceil(original * scale) by
